--   Ethics and law (NEW KB "Medical Ethics and Law"): q_sba_ethics_resource_allocation_001 (SBA, Medicolegal), q_mtf_confidentiality_disclosure_001 (MTF, Medicolegal), q_sba_duty_of_candour_wrong_site_block_001 (SBA, Medicolegal), q_mtf_clinical_negligence_standard_of_care_001 (MTF, Medicolegal)
--   Cannabinoids (KB "Cannabinoid System", extended in 039; + NICE NG144 relevantReading): q_mtf_thc_cbd_pharmacology_001 (MTF, Pharmacology), q_sba_nabiximols_ms_spasticity_001 (SBA, Pharmacology), q_sba_cannabis_chronic_pain_nice_001 (SBA, Clinical Pain), q_mtf_cannabinoid_adverse_effects_001 (MTF, Pharmacology)
--   AL-TENS (KB "TENS and Gate Control Theory", extended in 039): q_sba_altens_mechanism_001 (SBA, Physics & Clinical Measurement), q_mtf_altens_opioid_naloxone_001 (MTF, Physics & Clinical Measurement), q_sba_altens_parameters_001 (SBA, Physics & Clinical Measurement), q_sba_altens_impaired_sensation_001 (SBA, Physics & Clinical Measurement)
